    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There are many cat cafes these days. But have you been to a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "piglet",
            "zh": "小猪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " cafe?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mipig is a coffee shop in Tokyo, Japan. It is also home to cute mini-pigs. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wag",
            "zh": "摇晃"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their tails just like "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "puppies",
            "zh": "小狗"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". You can "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pat",
            "zh": "轻拍"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them while they sit in your "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lap",
            "ref": "v-lap"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and make cute "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "snorting",
            "ref": "v-snort"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " noises."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The pigs are so small. They can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fit",
            "ref": "v-fit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into a teacup. That’s why they are also called “teacup pigs”. But the teacup pig is not a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "breed",
            "ref": "v-breed"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of pig. They are just small or very young pigs. They will grow up and get bigger."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In Japan, not many people keep piglets as "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pets",
            "zh": "宠物"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Most Japanese people don’t know this animal very well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“Their noses feel cool, but their bodies are so warm. How cute!” said one visitor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
